# ITEM 12(a), 2026-08-29 — LIVE MEASUREMENT HISTORY, UNTRACKED ON PURPOSE.
# A file a running cycle rewrites every night must never be restorable-over by a
# checkout. On 2026-08-28 a `git reset --hard` did exactly that to 86 tracked
# files and destroyed 68 days of this series; HEAD still held the pre-recovery
# 267,524 bytes (866 points, latest 2026-06-21) while the live file held 1,848.
# A fresh clone starts from data/seed/axis_history.seed.json, which is generated
# by `venv/Scripts/python.exe tools/make_seed.py --write` and carries its own
# provenance. THE SEED IS NOT A BACKUP: if the two disagree, the live file is
# right. Never restore this path from git.
memory/axis_history.json

